  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per-A 102.10 “Employee” means a person in the state classified service whose appointment to work has been approved by the appointing authority and the director.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Per-A 100) #7377, eff 10-23-00",
